            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features full Steam Workshop integration for custom levels!</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Afterbeat&quot; is a musical bullet-hell in which all things beautiful are deadly. A cacophony of lights, music, pulses and blocks, Afterbeat features tight bullet-hell style gameplay where up to 4 players in local co-op must navigate their way through evolving scenes and obstacles, all timed to the beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 207X, a mysterious disease called &quot;LMNS&quot; has been ravaging the world. A lone Chiral researcher, Anna Schroeder, attempts to find the cure with her trusty supercomputer companion HAL. Stumbling upon various “Projects,” the duo decides to investigate the efficacy of a cure using a pulse/rhythm-based interface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Mode:</strong> Over 20+ hand-crafted, heart-pounding levels interwoven with an engaging story with multiple endings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge The Beat:</strong> Stages consist of mesmerizing, musically timed scenes, each one telling a story. Feel the rhythm and feel your way around the hazards! Anna will judge how you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Friends:</strong> Up to 4 players supported in local co-op mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Level Editor:</strong> A carefully designed level editor allows users to create their own levels and challenges using whatever music they wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge Community:</strong> A Wealth of user-created content exists, fully integrated into the game through the usage of the level editor and user-made levels. Already, 2000+ community levels have been uploaded, and more are being made daily.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game was previously named &quot;Project Arrhythmia.&quot;</i></strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Afterbeat&quot; is a musical bullet-hell in which all things beautiful are deadly. A cacophony of lights, music, pulses and blocks, Afterbeat features tight bullet-hell style gameplay where up to 4 players in local co-op must navigate their way through evolving scenes and obstacles, all timed to the beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 207X, a mysterious disease called &quot;LMNS&quot; has been ravaging the world. A lone Chiral researcher, Anna Schroeder, attempts to find the cure with her trusty supercomputer companion HAL. Stumbling upon various “Projects,” the duo decides to investigate the efficacy of a cure using a pulse/rhythm-based interface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Mode:</strong> Over 20+ hand-crafted, heart-pounding levels interwoven with an engaging story with multiple endings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge The Beat:</strong> Stages consist of mesmerizing, musically timed scenes, each one telling a story. Feel the rhythm and feel your way around the hazards! Anna will judge how you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Friends:</strong> Up to 4 players supported in local co-op mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Level Editor:</strong> A carefully designed level editor allows users to create their own levels and challenges using whatever music they wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge Community:</strong> A Wealth of user-created content exists, fully integrated into the game through the usage of the level editor and user-made levels. Already, 2000+ community levels have been uploaded, and more are being made daily.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game was previously named &quot;Project Arrhythmia.&quot;</i></strong></p>",
